1
00:00:00,329 --> 00:00:04,959
So I would like to discuss about meditation.

2
00:00:04,959 --> 00:00:06,502
But first of all,

3
00:00:06,502 --> 00:00:10,590
I'd like to ask you a very simple question.

4
00:00:10,590 --> 00:00:12,717
Can you see my hand?

5
00:00:12,717 --> 00:00:14,427
Yes, raise your hand.

6
00:00:14,427 --> 00:00:15,636
Audience: Yes.

7
00:00:15,636 --> 00:00:17,764
Yongey Mingyur Rinpoche: OK, can you hear me?

8
00:00:17,764 --> 00:00:19,348
Audience: Yes.

9
00:00:19,348 --> 00:00:21,100
YMR: Yes?

10
00:00:21,100 --> 00:00:22,477
Great.

11
00:00:22,477 --> 00:00:24,645
That is the meditation.

12
00:00:24,645 --> 00:00:26,189
So, finished.

13
00:00:26,189 --> 00:00:27,607
My TED Talk is finished.

14
00:00:27,607 --> 00:00:31,444
(Laughter and applause)

15
00:00:31,444 --> 00:00:34,322
Of course, I'm just kidding.

16
00:00:34,322 --> 00:00:37,033
But in a way that is true.

17
00:00:37,033 --> 00:00:38,201
Why?

18
00:00:38,201 --> 00:00:43,331
What we call the essence of meditation is awareness.

19
00:00:43,331 --> 00:00:45,166
And what is awareness?

20
00:00:45,166 --> 00:00:47,293
Knows what you are thinking,

21
00:00:47,293 --> 00:00:50,296
feeling, doing, seeing, hearing.

22
00:00:50,296 --> 00:00:51,964
That's all.

23
00:00:51,964 --> 00:00:55,551
So actually meditation is very easy,

24
00:00:55,551 --> 00:00:59,388
but many people find it difficult.

25
00:00:59,388 --> 00:01:00,598
Why?

26
00:01:00,598 --> 00:01:04,268
There are two misunderstandings about meditation.

27
00:01:04,268 --> 00:01:09,148
So the first is many people think meditation means, think of nothing,

28
00:01:09,148 --> 00:01:11,025
stop thinking,

29
00:01:11,025 --> 00:01:12,693
concentration.

30
00:01:12,693 --> 00:01:13,861
Ah.

31
00:01:13,861 --> 00:01:15,113
(Laughter)

32
00:01:15,113 --> 00:01:16,322
Shh!

33
00:01:16,322 --> 00:01:18,157
I'm meditating, keep quiet.

34
00:01:18,157 --> 00:01:20,576
(Laughter)

35
00:01:20,576 --> 00:01:24,080
So the more, when you try to stop thinking

36
00:01:24,080 --> 00:01:25,832
what happens, you will think more.

37
00:01:25,832 --> 00:01:29,418
So we will do a small experiment, OK?

38
00:01:29,418 --> 00:01:33,214
Now, please don't think about pizza.

39
00:01:33,214 --> 00:01:34,465
(Laughter)

40
00:01:34,465 --> 00:01:37,051
No pizza.

41
00:01:37,051 --> 00:01:39,011
No pizza.

42
00:01:39,011 --> 00:01:40,471
What happened?

43
00:01:40,471 --> 00:01:42,431
Did you think about pizza or not?

44
00:01:42,431 --> 00:01:43,891
Yes, raise your hand.

45
00:01:43,891 --> 00:01:45,143
(Laughter)

46
00:01:45,143 --> 00:01:46,435
I know.

47
00:01:46,435 --> 00:01:49,105
(Laughter)

48
00:01:49,105 --> 00:01:52,942
Actually, we don't need to stop thinking.

49
00:01:52,942 --> 00:01:55,987
We just need to connect with awareness.

50
00:01:55,987 --> 00:01:58,573
And another misunderstanding about meditation

51
00:01:58,573 --> 00:02:01,784
is what we call “blissing out.”

52
00:02:01,784 --> 00:02:05,329
Looking for peace, calm, joy,

53
00:02:05,329 --> 00:02:06,747
relax.

54
00:02:06,747 --> 00:02:09,083
(Laughter)

55
00:02:09,083 --> 00:02:11,669
The more you look for relax,

56
00:02:11,669 --> 00:02:14,505
then peace, calm, joy, relax run away.

57
00:02:14,505 --> 00:02:17,008
So ...

58
00:02:17,008 --> 00:02:19,093
Let me share [with] you my own experience.

59
00:02:19,093 --> 00:02:21,345
When I was young, I had panic attacks.

60
00:02:21,345 --> 00:02:25,308
Although I was born right in the middle of the Himalayan mountains,

61
00:02:25,308 --> 00:02:27,894
the area, the village, wonderful,

62
00:02:27,894 --> 00:02:30,980
but panic followed me like a shadow.

63
00:02:30,980 --> 00:02:36,736
And I have so much fear [of] strangers, I cannot go out and meet people.

64
00:02:36,736 --> 00:02:39,530
And lot of storms in the Himalayan mountains,

65
00:02:39,530 --> 00:02:42,533
thunderstorm, snowstorm.

66
00:02:42,533 --> 00:02:45,828
These storms drive me crazy.

67
00:02:45,828 --> 00:02:47,580
And when I was nine years old,

68
00:02:47,580 --> 00:02:50,291
I asked my father to teach me meditation.

69
00:02:50,291 --> 00:02:53,711
Luckily, he was a great meditation teacher.

70
00:02:53,711 --> 00:02:55,588
And the first thing what he said is,

71
00:02:55,588 --> 00:02:58,049
"Don't try to fight with the panic.

72
00:02:58,049 --> 00:03:01,302
Don't try to get rid of panic."

73
00:03:01,302 --> 00:03:04,222
"And actually," he said, "you don't have to." Why?

74
00:03:04,222 --> 00:03:08,142
Awareness is like sky in the mountain,

75
00:03:08,142 --> 00:03:13,022
and the panic is like storm in the mountain, like cloud.

76
00:03:13,022 --> 00:03:17,568
And no matter how strong a storm is,

77
00:03:17,568 --> 00:03:20,613
it doesn't change the nature of sky.

78
00:03:20,613 --> 00:03:24,617
So sky is always present, pure, calm.

79
00:03:24,617 --> 00:03:29,455
Similarly, our fundamental quality of mind, awareness

80
00:03:29,455 --> 00:03:32,875
is always present, pure, calm.

81
00:03:32,875 --> 00:03:36,837
But the problem is we don't know how to connect with awareness,

82
00:03:36,837 --> 00:03:38,089
what we see,

83
00:03:38,089 --> 00:03:40,758
only a thought, emotion, that's all.

84
00:03:40,758 --> 00:03:44,637
So he said, there are three steps of practice to connect with awareness.

85
00:03:44,637 --> 00:03:48,140
The first one, we have to use an object.

86
00:03:48,140 --> 00:03:50,518
Support, to connect with awareness.

87
00:03:50,518 --> 00:03:54,021
So this is one of my first meditation techniques

88
00:03:54,021 --> 00:03:55,940
that I learned from my father.

89
00:03:55,940 --> 00:04:00,236
So you can join and you can relax your muscles in your body.

90
00:04:00,236 --> 00:04:02,697
If you cannot relax, also OK, allowed.

91
00:04:02,697 --> 00:04:03,739
(Laughter)

92
00:04:03,739 --> 00:04:08,411
And close your eyes, and please listen to sound.

93
00:04:08,411 --> 00:04:11,455
(Ding)

94
00:04:11,455 --> 00:04:14,792
And when you hear the sound,

95
00:04:14,792 --> 00:04:18,212
through ear and mind together ...

96
00:04:18,212 --> 00:04:20,214
(Ding)

97
00:04:20,214 --> 00:04:23,217
That is the meditation.

98
00:04:23,217 --> 00:04:25,970
And let panic come and go.

99
00:04:25,970 --> 00:04:28,639
Let pizza come and go.

100
00:04:28,639 --> 00:04:30,349
(Ding)

101
00:04:30,349 --> 00:04:35,604
And maybe two pizzas, three pizzas, ten pizzas.

102
00:04:35,604 --> 00:04:38,316
As long as you remember the sound,

103
00:04:38,316 --> 00:04:39,984
you can have pizza.

104
00:04:39,984 --> 00:04:45,990
(Ding)

105
00:04:45,990 --> 00:04:49,493
(Ding)

106
00:04:49,493 --> 00:04:54,332
(Ding)

107
00:04:54,332 --> 00:04:56,292
OK, how was it?

108
00:04:56,292 --> 00:04:58,377
Did you hear the sound?

109
00:04:58,377 --> 00:05:00,546
Yes, raise your hand.

110
00:05:00,546 --> 00:05:01,714
Great.

111
00:05:01,714 --> 00:05:03,132
That is the meditation.

112
00:05:03,132 --> 00:05:04,300
Very easy.

113
00:05:04,300 --> 00:05:05,718
Just hear, that's all.

114
00:05:05,718 --> 00:05:07,720
You don't have to do anything.

115
00:05:07,720 --> 00:05:10,306
So if panic comes, let panic come and go, don't care.

116
00:05:10,306 --> 00:05:11,932
Just listen to sound.

117
00:05:11,932 --> 00:05:13,768
Monkey mind comes blah, blah, blah.

118
00:05:13,768 --> 00:05:16,854
Let it come and go, just listen to sound.

119
00:05:16,854 --> 00:05:18,356
So I did that.

120
00:05:18,356 --> 00:05:19,690
But I had a big problem.

121
00:05:19,690 --> 00:05:21,484
The problem is lazy.

122
00:05:21,484 --> 00:05:22,485
(Laughter)

123
00:05:22,485 --> 00:05:25,029
I'm lazy boy, I love the idea of meditation,

124
00:05:25,029 --> 00:05:28,366
but I don't like the practice of meditation.

125
00:05:28,366 --> 00:05:31,243
So on and off like that for five years.

126
00:05:31,243 --> 00:05:34,205
When I was 13 years old in India,

127
00:05:34,205 --> 00:05:37,750
there's traditional three-year retreat going to start.

128
00:05:37,750 --> 00:05:41,587
I thought I should join this because it's good for my laziness.

129
00:05:41,587 --> 00:05:43,172
And I join.

130
00:05:43,172 --> 00:05:46,050
The first month, wonderful, no lazy.

131
00:05:46,050 --> 00:05:47,718
Second month, lazy come back.

132
00:05:47,718 --> 00:05:48,969
(Laughter)

133
00:05:48,969 --> 00:05:50,137
Now what happened?

134
00:05:50,137 --> 00:05:53,099
My lazy and my panic, they two become good friends.

135
00:05:53,099 --> 00:05:54,350
(Laughter)

136
00:05:54,350 --> 00:05:58,354
The life in the retreat becomes disaster.

137
00:05:58,354 --> 00:05:59,939
And I thought I should leave.

138
00:05:59,939 --> 00:06:01,440
But I feel embarrassed to leave

139
00:06:01,440 --> 00:06:05,236
because I told all my childhood friends that I can do the retreat, you know.

140
00:06:05,236 --> 00:06:06,946
I don't want to lose my face.

141
00:06:06,946 --> 00:06:08,739
But if I stay,

142
00:06:08,739 --> 00:06:10,616
almost three years to go.

143
00:06:10,616 --> 00:06:12,701
Then I thought, what should I do?

144
00:06:12,701 --> 00:06:17,832
In the end, I decided to learn how to live with the panic.

145
00:06:17,832 --> 00:06:20,835
So now we have the second step what we call,

146
00:06:20,835 --> 00:06:24,296
actually, we can meditate everywhere,

147
00:06:24,296 --> 00:06:26,799
anytime with anything.

148
00:06:26,799 --> 00:06:29,176
So you can meditate with panic.

149
00:06:29,176 --> 00:06:30,469
How do you do that?

150
00:06:30,469 --> 00:06:31,929
Just like listen to sound,

151
00:06:31,929 --> 00:06:33,180
when you listen to sound,

152
00:06:33,180 --> 00:06:35,558
sound becomes support for your meditation.

153
00:06:35,558 --> 00:06:37,726
Now you're going to watch panic.

154
00:06:37,726 --> 00:06:40,563
If you see the panic, great.

155
00:06:40,563 --> 00:06:44,608
What we call, when you see the river, you're out of the river.

156
00:06:44,608 --> 00:06:47,319
When you see the mountain, you're out of the montain.

157
00:06:47,319 --> 00:06:51,574
So now awareness becomes more than panic.

158
00:06:51,574 --> 00:06:54,160
More than depression, stress.

159
00:06:54,160 --> 00:06:55,369
Monkey mind, whatever.

160
00:06:55,369 --> 00:06:57,371
Let them come, let them go.

161
00:06:57,371 --> 00:07:00,916
So that is the first benefit and second benefit of what we call,

162
00:07:00,916 --> 00:07:02,877
there's a wisdom comes.

163
00:07:02,877 --> 00:07:05,004
So when you look at the panic,

164
00:07:05,004 --> 00:07:07,965
panic is not solid stone anymore.

165
00:07:07,965 --> 00:07:09,800
Panic becomes pieces.

166
00:07:09,800 --> 00:07:16,599
Sensation here, frightening image, voice, background belief.

167
00:07:16,599 --> 00:07:21,228
And if you take one of these away, you cannot find panic.

168
00:07:21,228 --> 00:07:24,773
So what I call panic becomes like shaving foam,

169
00:07:24,773 --> 00:07:29,028
looks like a piece of rock but inside full of bubbles.

170
00:07:29,028 --> 00:07:33,532
Then three, what I call this is acceptance,

171
00:07:33,532 --> 00:07:37,953
like self-kind, self-love, self-compassion.

172
00:07:37,953 --> 00:07:40,331
You let panic come and go,

173
00:07:40,331 --> 00:07:42,500
that's the real acceptance, isn't it?

174
00:07:42,500 --> 00:07:44,502
So three in one:

175
00:07:44,502 --> 00:07:46,921
awareness, love and compassion, wisdom.

176
00:07:46,921 --> 00:07:49,882
Sometimes what I call buy one, get two free.

177
00:07:49,882 --> 00:07:51,091
(Laughter)

178
00:07:51,091 --> 00:07:52,801
Big deal, right?

179
00:07:52,801 --> 00:07:56,055
And all this because of panic.

180
00:07:56,055 --> 00:07:58,390
So now panic becomes your teacher,

181
00:07:58,390 --> 00:08:00,559
your best friend.

182
00:08:00,559 --> 00:08:02,645
So I did this practice and in the end,

183
00:08:02,645 --> 00:08:04,939
me and my panic become very good friends.

184
00:08:04,939 --> 00:08:07,525
And few weeks later, panic is gone.

185
00:08:07,525 --> 00:08:09,652
I miss my friend.

186
00:08:09,652 --> 00:08:12,196
And I finished my retreat, my retreat went very well.

187
00:08:12,196 --> 00:08:17,409
And after that I have been eager to share this wonderful technique with the world.

188
00:08:17,409 --> 00:08:19,954
So I taught meditation many places,

189
00:08:19,954 --> 00:08:22,998
wrote three books, become bestseller,

190
00:08:22,998 --> 00:08:27,294
and then students and become abbot of a few monasteries.

191
00:08:27,294 --> 00:08:28,921
And what happened?

192
00:08:28,921 --> 00:08:32,508
Kind of new ego emerged within me.

193
00:08:32,508 --> 00:08:35,553
I thought, oh, I have to watch out, this so.

194
00:08:35,553 --> 00:08:38,347
Then I decided to do something very special,

195
00:08:38,347 --> 00:08:40,683
what we call wandering retreat.

196
00:08:40,683 --> 00:08:43,185
Meaning you leave everything behind,

197
00:08:43,185 --> 00:08:45,145
go on the street with nothing.

198
00:08:45,145 --> 00:08:47,398
So I decided to do that.

199
00:08:47,398 --> 00:08:51,151
In 2011, I left my monastery, my students,

200
00:08:51,151 --> 00:08:53,988
my wonderful cozy bed.

201
00:08:53,988 --> 00:08:59,201
Everything, and got on street with only a few thousand Indian rupees,

202
00:08:59,201 --> 00:09:01,328
and that finished within a few weeks.

203
00:09:01,328 --> 00:09:03,747
Now I have to beg for food.

204
00:09:03,747 --> 00:09:06,125
And I got food poisoning.

205
00:09:06,125 --> 00:09:08,711
Vomiting, diarrhea.

206
00:09:08,711 --> 00:09:10,421
I'm alone on the street,

207
00:09:10,421 --> 00:09:12,881
now I'm going to die.

208
00:09:12,881 --> 00:09:14,466
Then I thought, what should I do?

209
00:09:14,466 --> 00:09:17,011
So now we have the third step,

210
00:09:17,011 --> 00:09:20,598
what we call open awareness meditation.

211
00:09:20,598 --> 00:09:22,850
Awareness, be with itself.

212
00:09:22,850 --> 00:09:24,768
Sky, be with itself.

213
00:09:24,768 --> 00:09:27,813
Now, no need to have support.

214
00:09:27,813 --> 00:09:29,565
Just be awareness itself.

215
00:09:29,565 --> 00:09:31,650
I did that practice.

216
00:09:31,650 --> 00:09:33,193
Then what happened?

217
00:09:33,193 --> 00:09:35,321
My body become decayed,

218
00:09:35,321 --> 00:09:38,324
I cannot see, I cannot hear.

219
00:09:38,324 --> 00:09:41,327
But my mind becomes so present,

220
00:09:41,327 --> 00:09:44,038
beyond free.

221
00:09:44,038 --> 00:09:46,624
And I was in that state for a few hours.

222
00:09:46,624 --> 00:09:48,834
Luckily, I didn't die, I come back.

223
00:09:48,834 --> 00:09:51,795
So when I come back, the street becomes like my home.

224
00:09:51,795 --> 00:09:55,924
When I look at a tree, tree becomes like tree of love.

225
00:09:55,924 --> 00:10:00,971
And the wind blows to my face become a joyful experience.

226
00:10:00,971 --> 00:10:03,307
And the rest of my retreat went very well.

227
00:10:03,307 --> 00:10:05,559
I learned a lot from my retreat.

228
00:10:05,559 --> 00:10:08,854
So I like to share this open awareness meditation,

229
00:10:08,854 --> 00:10:12,650
but it is very difficult to explain.

230
00:10:12,650 --> 00:10:17,237
But I want to do something drama.

231
00:10:17,237 --> 00:10:19,365
And this is what I learned from my father.

232
00:10:19,365 --> 00:10:22,993
So what we call, this mala is the crazy monkey mind,

233
00:10:22,993 --> 00:10:25,454
blah, blah, blah, yada yada.

234
00:10:25,454 --> 00:10:28,999
And the open awareness meditation means you don't have to do anything.

235
00:10:28,999 --> 00:10:34,630
Just be.

236
00:10:34,630 --> 00:10:37,383
That's all, and you don't need to meditate.

237
00:10:37,383 --> 00:10:43,931
The sense of presence, being, but not loss.

238
00:10:43,931 --> 00:10:45,766
Be free.

239
00:10:45,766 --> 00:10:46,934
Be present.

240
00:10:46,934 --> 00:10:48,143
Thank you very much.

241
00:10:48,143 --> 00:10:52,143
(Applause)
